The new `BundlePolicyTypeVerifier.java` ensures that `BundlePolicyValue`
only contains supported value types.
`BundlePolicySerializer` is updated to thrown an exception when it
encounters an unsupported value type, as an extra safety measure.

Bug: 515038894
Flag: EXEMPT CVE_FIX
Test: atest BundlePolicySerializerTest
Test: atest PolicyValueTest
Test: atest ApplicationRestrictionsTest#setApplicationRestrictions_invalidBundleType_throwsIllegalArgumentException
